  "solution": "**Given**\n\n8 + ((1)/(2) + (1)/(4)) × 16 \n\n**Concept:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c6dff4d58ce66b38e0cdda1b0a721fa32c2ef301f704e653b2f493673a6e332b.png] \n\n**Calculation**\n\n⇒ 8 + {(2 + 1)over 4} × 16\n\n⇒ 8 + 3over 4 × 16\n\n⇒ 8 + 12\n\n⇒ 20\n\n**∴ The value of 8 + ((1)/(2) + (1)/(4)) × 16 is 20**",
